# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
An artistic illustration for the tea page "Enshi Yulu (Jade Dew)": misty layered mountain ridges of western Hubei at dawn, a bamboo steaming basket with soft rising steam in the middle ground, and a close foreground of fine straight dark-jade tea needles beside a clear glass cup holding luminous green-gold liquor; wet-on-wet ink wash textures, restrained jade and grey-green color accents, soft paper grain; calm, minimal, museum-poster feel; no text, no letters, no characters, no logos.
